  "confirmed_properties": [
    "Encoder builds a prefix trie and shares nodes only under equal terminal status and sorted edge/right-language signatures.",
    "Forward-only references and the decoder's bottom-up suffix equivalence check establish a finite acyclic language with no duplicate right-language nodes.",
    "Lexicographic DFS plus the exact integer rank permutation restores original prefix-list order, including terminal nodes with longer words.",
    "All selected retained languages match a separately implemented DFS and independently enumerated finite right-language node counts.",
    "The adapter restores old kind and unchanged header values and delegates the ordered prefix list to refinement_oracle.check_certificate.",
    "The unchanged checker _lift_prefix initializes all correlated initial frames per complete prefix, preserves distinct bindings, accumulates sticky unknown, and independently verifies complete coverage and horizon. The codec introduces no frame or global failure cache.",
    "Prefix count, horizon, expanded edge count, labels, nodes, arcs, and generated/expanded payload sizes have explicit checks. Three input/refusal gaps remain as recorded below."
  ],
